    "summary": "I built a compact desk unit from three bases set in a small triangle. One is a north half base with a sliding drawer in its open cut face, which faces south. Where the three bases meet there is a mount spike holding a small platform. I closed the open edges with end caps and bolted the joints together. The build check found no rule problems, and the collision check came back clear. The unit has 18 printed parts, using about 1264 g of filament over roughly 1833 minutes of printing. I added no props, since the brief only asked for the hardware.",
    "outcome": "built"
